> alsa-info.sh: add dmesg info on ALSA/HDA
> 
> Add outputs:
> 		dmesg | grep -E 'ALSA|HDA|HDMI|sound|hda.codec|hda.intel'
> which should cover most ALSA HDA kernel messages.
> 
> Signed-off-by: Wu Fengguang <fengguang.wu@intel.com>
